<name><surname>Ustenko</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Formal Employment and Survival Strategies After Communism</article-title><source>"Transforming Post-Communist Political Economies"</source><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://newton.nap.edu/html/transform/contents.htm"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>